---
layout: base.njk
title: Projects
---
<h1>Projects</h1>

<p>A running list of things I've built. Add a new one by dropping a markdown
file in <code>src/projects/</code> — no HTML to copy.</p>

<ul class="project-list">
  {%- for project in collections.projects %}
  <li class="project-card">
    <h2><a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ project.data.summary }}</p>
    {%- if project.data.tags %}
    <p class="tags">{{ project.data.tags | join(", ") }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
